-- ============================================================
-- I. SOS HIERARCHY
-- ============================================================

-- Sum-of-squares (SOS) hierarchy of convex relaxations
-- Level-t SOS can be solved in n^{O(t)} time

-- ============================================================
-- II. SOS AND NP
-- ============================================================

-- SOS of sufficiently high degree can solve many NP-hard problems
-- But the required degree may be polynomial in n (not constant)

-- ============================================================
-- III. SOS AND CERTIFIES
-- ============================================================

-- SOS provides certificates for optimization problems
-- Certificates can be verified in polynomial time

-- ============================================================
-- IV. CONNECTION TO P VS NP
-- ============================================================

-- SOS does not imply P = NP
-- But it provides practical algorithms for many problems

